### `parseGCode()` — codes tracked (lines 255–656)

- **M-codes handled** (lines 437–447): only `M82` (relative E off), `M83` (relative E on), `M203` (max speed, `w.X`), `M204` (`S`/`P`/`T` → accelPrint/accelTravel), `M205` (`X` → jerk). **No M104/M109/M140/M190/M106/M107 handling at all** — temperature and fan-speed G-code commands are completely ignored/unparsed. Also a Klipper `SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT` line (not a G/M code) is special-cased before the `G/M` regex, lines 419–431, reading `VELOCITY`, `ACCEL`, `ACCEL_TO_DECEL`, `SQUARE_CORNER_VELOCITY` params via `VELOCITY_PARAM_RE`.
